@startuml
actor User
participant "Web Page / Editor" as Page
participant "Content Script\n(Grammarly-check.js)" as CS
participant "Service Worker\n(sw.js / Grammarly-bg.js)" as SW
participant "IFrame Helper\n(Grammarly-gDocsIframeCs.js)" as Iframe
database "chrome.storage" as Storage
participant "Grammarly Cloud API\n(capi.grammarly.com)" as CAPI
participant "Config / Telemetry\n(config.extension.grammarly.com)" as Config

User -> Page: Types or edits text
Page -> CS: Detect focus & keypress
CS -> SW: Connect port or sendMessage("documentState")
SW -> Storage: Read feature gates & configurations
Storage --> SW: Config / treatments state
SW -> Config: Fetch latest feature gates (treatment.grammarly.com)
CS -> Iframe: window.postMessage (frame synchronization)
CS -> CAPI: wss://capi.grammarly.com (WebSocket revision stream)
CAPI --> CS: Writing suggestions & alerts
CS -> Page: Inject Grammarly cards & underline markers
User -> CS: Accept suggestion / click card
CS -> SW: Track event / write analytics (feMetricsData)
SW -> Storage: Cache event telemetry (local / session)
SW -> Config: POST https://femetrics.grammarly.io/log (upload batch)
@enduml
